This artificial Christmas tree features a pencil slim design ideal for smaller spaces. The white plastic construction provides a fresh-cut appearance throughout the festive season. Dense branch tips create a lush look that enhances any holiday display effectively.

The realistic branch tips are made from high-quality dense plastic needles. This material ensures durability and maintains its shape after repeated use each year. The solid stand offers stability while providing ample room for hanging decorative ornaments safely.

Setup is quick and easy with simple push-together pieces and fold-out branches. Users can assemble the tree without complex tools or lengthy instructions. Spreading out individual tips helps achieve the best possible full appearance for your home decor.

The tree measures 180cm in height with a compact base width of 55cm. Its narrow profile makes it suitable for living rooms, bedrooms or offices. The white colour complements various interior styles and traditional festive themes effortlessly.

Only the tree and stand are included with this purchase option. Ornaments are not included but can be added to personalise the display further. This product serves as a great gift for families who enjoy decorating their homes together annually.
